The copyright in the original work remains with its authors. This product is independent: it is not affiliated with, endorsed
by or operated by the original project or its operators, and it uses none of their branding, accounts, data feeds or services.

Statement of modifications (Apache License 2.0, section 4(b)). Compared with the original, this version:
  - replaces the whole public site, page templates and data model with a read-only catalogue served from a reviewed read model;
  - removes all write endpoints, request-time language-model and web-scraping code, analytics, advertising and the inherited
    page template;
  - adds an import and review pipeline (tools/upstream-import, db/) with its own database schema, publication gates and tests;
  - upgrades the framework and dependencies and changes the build and test setup.
Files that were changed from the original carry no separate per-file notice; the version control history records every change.

Third-party components are used under their own licences, installed from the npm registry (see package.json and the lock file).
No third-party fonts, images or page templates are bundled in this repository.

Data: the import pipeline reads public GitHub issues and repositories. Imported text is kept as source records and is not
republished; published summaries are written for this directory. See reports/import-eligibility-policy.md.
